# Visakan Veerasamy

Visakan Veerasamy describes his aim as building a network of friendly, ambitious nerds. [His public site](https://visakanv.com/).

His book *Friendly Ambitious Nerd* is a collection of his essays, blog posts, and Twitter threads. [Book page](https://visakanv.com/friendly-ambitious-nerd/) [Announcement](https://x.com/visakanv/status/1225025217237417987).
